<title>PAKISTAN: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE BY NINE WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT ZIMBABWE BY NINE WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>LAHORE, Pakistan 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Zimbabwe by</p>
<p>nine wickets in the second of three one-day internationals in</p>
<p>Lahore on Friday, giving them an unbeatable 2-0 series lead.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 195 all out (49.1 overs); Pakistan 196-1</p>
<p>(28.4 overs).</p>
</text>
